<figure id="A1.T6" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span>Robustness experiment with a fixed hyperparameter set on LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct. Reported in accuracy (%). The fixed set used is: # thought tokens = 8, # steps = 20, top-<math id="A1.T6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> = 10, sigma = 5, sigma decay = 0.9, lr = 5e-3.</figcaption>
